Third-party components
----------------------

Mozilla Rhino (https://github.com/mozilla/rhino), MPL-2.0.
  The build downloads the source of upstream commit
  8527ebbf6d0b1599f819b5001af06e5dd9147013 (Rhino 1.9.1), verifies its SHA-256,
  applies the patches in rhino/patches (written for Vellum; they modify Rhino's
  core module and stay under MPL-2.0), and relocates the classes into a shadow
  package. Distributed jars carry Rhino's LICENSE, NOTICE and a SOURCE note under
  META-INF/licenses/rhino/. The patch series in this repository is the source
  form of those modifications.

Taffy layout test fixtures (https://github.com/DioxusLabs/taffy), MIT.
  engine/src/test/resources/taffy/ holds Chrome-generated layout fixtures from
  Taffy; their license is in that directory. They are test data only and are not
  shipped in any jar.
